# Generated Python trainer cache. The fine-tuning pipeline lives in its own
# repository alongside this one; this is only a compiled cache that happened to
# be written inside the API workspace.
apps/api/unsloth_compiled_cache/
__pycache__/
*.bak
# *.bak alone does not catch a timestamped backup such as
# apps/api/.env.bak-20260815, which holds JWT_SECRET and DATABASE_URL in
# plain text. Anything derived from an env file must be ignored however it
# is suffixed.
*.bak-*
.env.bak*
.env.*.bak
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.env
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local
.expo/
apps/mobile/.expo/
apps/mobile/.eas/
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p8
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa
*.log

# Coursework and project-writeup material is deliberately kept out of this
# repository. It lives in ../Planora-FYP. This is an application repo: reports,
# thesis drafts, agent prompts and run logs are not useful to anyone using or
# reading Planora, so they are excluded rather than merely untracked.
FYP-*.md
*-ANSWERS.md
*Thesis*.md
*thesis*.md
PROJECT_COMPLETE_RECORD.txt
OVERNIGHT-REPORT.md
MORNING-REPORT.md
logs/
